    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*Game is currently <strong>not actively</strong> under development. Dec 2024. The plan is to resume work on Asterminer around summer 2025.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Asterminer, explore the calm of space in a relaxed, atmospheric journey. Operate a mining ship, train, or walk around as the operator across distant planets and asteroids in a grounded sci-fi setting. It's a casual yet deep adventure with no danger, no enemies, and no violence, making space exploration a beautiful, contemplative experience. Enjoy the awesome music and the joy of gathering resources for your loved ones in this serene, unique game that celebrates the wonders of the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow @BenerotEmpire on twitter for regular updates.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*Game is currently <strong>not actively</strong> under development. Dec 2024. The plan is to resume work on Asterminer around summer 2025.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Asterminer, explore the calm of space in a relaxed, atmospheric journey. Operate a mining ship, train, or walk around as the operator across distant planets and asteroids in a grounded sci-fi setting. It's a casual yet deep adventure with no danger, no enemies, and no violence, making space exploration a beautiful, contemplative experience. Enjoy the awesome music and the joy of gathering resources for your loved ones in this serene, unique game that celebrates the wonders of the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow @BenerotEmpire on twitter for regular updates.</p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into a serene, atmospheric journey in space. Control a mining ship, train, and operator on distant planets and asteroids. Gather resources for your loved ones in this immersive, slow-paced, grounded sci-fi adventure.",
